# .secret-allowlist
# One regex pattern per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Any staged line matching a pattern here will NOT trigger a block.
#
# Examples:
#   # Allow a specific known-safe test key
#   AKIA00EXAMPLE00KEY00
#
#   # Allow a specific file's content pattern
#   my_known_safe_pattern

# SSH key fingerprints (43 base64 chars after SHA256:). Public, by design:
# the release workflow pins the hardware signing keys this way.
SHA256:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{43}
